\hspace*{10mm}with $p\in\intbracket{1,n}$ chosen so that $\sqrt{\frac{n}{p}}\Urandomtilde_{0,\ntp}\in\rnp$ is $WAM(\alpha_Q,\beta_Q)$ for some $\alpha_Q, \beta_Q\in(0,1/2)$.\\
\hspace*{10mm}Construct a PSS $\tilde{\mathbb{D}}^p_0\subset\spOne$ using {\bl any matrix} $\Drandomtildep_0\in\R^{p\times m}$, with $m\in {\bl \intbracket{p+1,2p}}$, {\bl generated}\\ 
